fff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">정정기간 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">: <strong>2014. 9. 15.(</strong></span><strong><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">월</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">) ~ 9. 16.(</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">화</span></strong><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\"><strong>)</strong> </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">매일 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\"><u>10:00 ~ 18:00</u></span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">까지</span></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">2. </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">정정신청서 제출장소 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-famil